:css
  /* Email styles need to be inline */

  h2 {
    font-weight: normal;
  }

%h2 Dear #{@username},

%p you are receiving this email because of your suSSHi account.

%br

%p
  To enhance the security of your account, two-factor authentication has been activated.
  %br
  Please login to your suSSHi Chef account and enter the activation code provided below when prompted:

%p{style: "font-weight: bold;"}= @activation_token

%p Afterwards, your personal TOTP secret will be created that can be scanned with your preferred authenticator app.

%br

%p If you have any questions, please contact our support team.

%br

%p Regards,
%p suSSHi Chef Administrator
